  {
   "id": "seg-03",
   "spk": "Alex",
   "en": "Before I leave, I review what I did today. Priya and I look for a detail in the build artifact. After lunch, I check the deployment environment again. Before the meeting, I review structured data one more time. The team talks about the log entry at the standup. At the table, Maria says, \"Could you replace it?\" I think, then answer, \"Thank you for resolving this.\" The deployment works. We watch the logs together.",
   "tts": "Before I leave, I review what I did today. Priya and I look for a detail in the build artifact. After lunch, I check the deployment environment again. Before the meeting, I review structured data one more time. The team talks about the log entry at the standup. At the table, Maria says, \"Could you replace it?\" I think, then answer, \"Thank you for resolving this.\" The deployment works. We watch the logs together.",
   "audio_file": "audio/seg-03.mp3",
   "zh": "离开前，我回顾了今天做的事。Priya 和我在构建产物里找一个细节。午饭后，我又检查了一遍部署环境。开会前，我又复习了一遍结构化数据。团队在站会上讨论了日志条目。桌边，Maria说：\"你可以更换它吗？\"我想了想，回答：\"谢谢你解决这个问题。\"部署成功了。我们一起观察日志。",
